{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lose everything to debt. Survive the streets, or be consumed by them.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lost your job. Your possessions were seized. Now, with nothing left, you\u2019re forced to start from the streets. Beg for change, sell small items, and scrape together enough money to pay off your crushing debt. But beware: if you miss a payment, it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, interact with strangers in traffic and on the streets\u2014some will help, some will ignore you, and some will push back. At night, return to your broken shelter: rest, store your belongings, and slowly upgrade your rundown shack into a place of safety and comfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters. Will you manage your money wisely, stay safe from theft, and keep your morale high? Or will the streets take everything from you once again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Streets:</strong> Beg, trade, and hustle to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Shelter:</strong> Start with a broken shack and transform it into a safe home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI\u2011Powered NPC Reactions:</strong> Begging and bartering yield unique, unpredictable replies\u2014some give, some refuse, some get angry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk &amp; Comfort:</strong> Manage hunger, energy, hygiene and the constant threat of theft.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972530?t=1759873666","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972530/1e617919dfd1f75ab39527395454a66170da35d0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759873666","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat